/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (Provide each child with a stuffed teddy bear or another soft, huggable object. Demonstrate the activity: give the teddy a tight hug or squeeze for 3 to 5 seconds, then completely relax your arms and body. Guide the children to repeat this sequence several times. Encourage them to notice how their muscles feel during the squeeze and the relaxation phases.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
