460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Begin by asking the child to lie on their tummy on a comfortable surface. Guide the child to use their left pointer finger to slowly trace the outline of their right ear. Once they've completed tracing their right ear, have them use their right pointer finger to slowly trace the outline of their left ear. Encourage the child to repeat this process five times with each hand, maintaining a slow and deliberate pace throughout the exercise.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
