<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1421 0 R
/E (Gather the children and show them the snake visual card, picture, or toy. Explain that they will be pretending to be snakes and making hissing sounds to help them relax. Demonstrate how to take a deep breath in and then slowly exhale while making a "ssssss" sound, like a snake hissing.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1422 0 R
/T (Invite the children to stand up, take a deep breath together, and hiss gently on the exhale. Encourage them to feel the vibrations in their chest and throat and to make the hissing sound as long and smooth as possible.)
/E (Invite the children to stand up, take a deep breath together, and hiss gently on the exhale. Encourage them to feel the vibrations in their chest and throat and to make the hissing sound as long and smooth as possible.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
